Shared migration workflow (Module M). See ../docs/migrations.md.

- env.py        : shared Alembic environment (DATABASE_URL or -x db_url, metadata, exclusions)
- ../app/models.py : imports feature-module SQLModel tables for Alembic metadata
- versions/     : one linear chain: 0001 D placeholder widget, 0002 G/H tables,
                  0003 G auction lots
- infra_probe   : dev/test-only table excluded by env.py

Add a revision:  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<module>: <change>"
Apply:           DATABASE_URL=... uv run alembic upgrade head

Run outside the Worker using psycopg, against Neon directly. Postgres tests
use TEST_DATABASE_URL (disposable *_modules_test).
